@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003
@orderId = <POST /orders yanıtındaki id'yi buraya yapıştırın>

### Ürünleri listele (Web adapter → IListProductsQuery)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Sipariş oluştur — DRIVING ADAPTER #1: HTTP (201 + { "id": "..." })
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Ödeme reddi (402) — 16 x Monitör = 104.000 TRY > 100.000 limit (FakePaymentGateway)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "items": [ { "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "quantity": 16 } ]
}

### Bilinmeyen ürün (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "items": [ { "productId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Sipariş oluştur — DRIVING ADAPTER #2: Kuyruk (202). Aynı IPlaceOrderUseCase tetiklenir; logları izleyin.
POST {{baseUrl}}/queue/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "items": [ { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "quantity": 3 } ]
}

### Siparişleri listele (kuyruktan gelen sipariş de burada)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Sipariş getir (200 / 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Kargola (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### İptal et (204, kargolanmışsa 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
